{"id":"3ac679b8b3bcfb15","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zfc-hereditarily-symmetric-name.md","title":"ZFC Hereditarily Symmetric Name","display":"df-zfc-hereditarily-symmetric-name — ZFC Hereditarily Symmetric Name","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-hereditarily-symmetric-name","aliases":["58-df-zfc-hereditarily-symmetric-name"],"display":"df-zfc-hereditarily-symmetric-name — ZFC Hereditarily Symmetric Name","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-name.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-hereditarily-symmetric-name"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-hereditarily-symmetric-name</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-hereditarily-symmetric-name — ZFC Hereditarily Symmetric Name"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-name.md\">../batch07/58-df-name.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"59685d062adf2748\" href=\"?note=59685d062adf2748\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md\">../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau,p,\\pi,P,\\leq_P,\\mathscr G,\\cdot,a,\\mathcal F\\in V\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau,p,\\pi,P,\\leq_P,\\mathscr G,\\cdot,a,\\mathcal F\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Name}\">\\(\\mathrm{Name}\\)</span> (forcing-name predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-name.md\">../batch07/58-df-name.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S(\\mathscr G,\\cdot)\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S(\\mathscr G,\\cdot)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,\\mathscr G,\\cdot)\">\\(\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,\\mathscr G,\\cdot)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:\\mathscr G\\to P^P\">\\(a:\\mathscr G\\to P^P\\)</span> (a candidate action by order automorphisms)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\star_a\\sigma\">\\(\\pi\\star_a\\sigma\\)</span> (recursive induced action on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>-names, defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SymmetrySystem}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{SymmetrySystem}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (explicit forcing symmetry system)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormalSymmetryFilter}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{NormalSymmetryFilter}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (normal filter of subgroups)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SymmetricName}_S,\\mathrm{HereditarilySymmetricName}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{SymmetricName}_S,\\mathrm{HereditarilySymmetricName}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> (name predicates)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}name\\text{-}action}\\vdash\n\\pi\\star_a\\sigma\n=\n\\{\\langle\\pi\\star_a\\tau,a(\\pi)(p)\\rangle:\\langle\\tau,p\\rangle\\in\\sigma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}name\\text{-}action}\\vdash\n\\pi\\star_a\\sigma\n=\n\\{\\langle\\pi\\star_a\\tau,a(\\pi)(p)\\rangle:\\langle\\tau,p\\rangle\\in\\sigma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}symmetry\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SymmetrySystem}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\mathscr G,\\cdot,a)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(\\mathscr G,\\cdot)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a,\\mathscr G,P^P)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists e\\in\\mathscr G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathscr G\\;\\bigl(\n\\cdot(\\langle e,\\pi\\rangle)=\\pi=\\cdot(\\langle\\pi,e\\rangle)\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;(a(e)(p)=p)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathscr G\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(a(\\pi),P,P)\n\\land\\forall p,q\\in P\\;(p\\leq_Pq\\leftrightarrow a(\\pi)(p)\\leq_Pa(\\pi)(q))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\forall\\pi,\\rho\\in\\mathscr G\\;\\forall p\\in P\\;\\bigl(\na(\\cdot(\\langle\\pi,\\rho\\rangle))(p)=a(\\pi)(a(\\rho)(p))\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}symmetry\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SymmetrySystem}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\mathscr G,\\cdot,a)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(\\mathscr G,\\cdot)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a,\\mathscr G,P^P)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists e\\in\\mathscr G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathscr G\\;\\bigl(\n\\cdot(\\langle e,\\pi\\rangle)=\\pi=\\cdot(\\langle\\pi,e\\rangle)\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;(a(e)(p)=p)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathscr G\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(a(\\pi),P,P)\n\\land\\forall p,q\\in P\\;(p\\leq_Pq\\leftrightarrow a(\\pi)(p)\\leq_Pa(\\pi)(q))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\forall\\pi,\\rho\\in\\mathscr G\\;\\forall p\\in P\\;\\bigl(\na(\\cdot(\\langle\\pi,\\rho\\rangle))(p)=a(\\pi)(a(\\rho)(p))\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}symmetry\\text{-}subgroups}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathscr G,\\cdot}\n=\\{H\\subseteq\\mathscr G:\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,\\mathscr G,\\cdot)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}symmetry\\text{-}subgroups}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathscr G,\\cdot}\n=\\{H\\subseteq\\mathscr G:\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,\\mathscr G,\\cdot)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}normal\\text{-}symmetry\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NormalSymmetryFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathscr G,\\cdot)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\mathcal F\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathscr G,\\cdot}\n\\land\\mathscr G\\in\\mathcal F\n\\land\\forall H\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\forall K\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathscr G,\\cdot}\\;\n(H\\subseteq K\\to K\\in\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall H,K\\in\\mathcal F\\;(H\\cap K\\in\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\exists e\\in\\mathscr G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall g\\in\\mathscr G\\;(\\cdot(\\langle e,g\\rangle)=g=\\cdot(\\langle g,e\\rangle))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{31mm}\\land\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathscr G\\;\\forall H\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\forall\\rho\\in\\mathscr G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\cdot(\\langle\\pi,\\rho\\rangle)=e=\\cdot(\\langle\\rho,\\pi\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{54mm}\\to\n\\{\\cdot(\\langle\\cdot(\\langle\\pi,h\\rangle),\\rho\\rangle):h\\in H\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}normal\\text{-}symmetry\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NormalSymmetryFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathscr G,\\cdot)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\mathcal F\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathscr G,\\cdot}\n\\land\\mathscr G\\in\\mathcal F\n\\land\\forall H\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\forall K\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathscr G,\\cdot}\\;\n(H\\subseteq K\\to K\\in\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall H,K\\in\\mathcal F\\;(H\\cap K\\in\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\exists e\\in\\mathscr G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall g\\in\\mathscr G\\;(\\cdot(\\langle e,g\\rangle)=g=\\cdot(\\langle g,e\\rangle))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{31mm}\\land\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathscr G\\;\\forall H\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\forall\\rho\\in\\mathscr G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\cdot(\\langle\\pi,\\rho\\rangle)=e=\\cdot(\\langle\\rho,\\pi\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{54mm}\\to\n\\{\\cdot(\\langle\\cdot(\\langle\\pi,h\\rangle),\\rho\\rangle):h\\in H\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}symmetric\\text{-}name}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SymmetricName}_S(\\sigma,P,\\leq_P,\\mathscr G,\\cdot,a,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SymmetrySystem}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\mathscr G,\\cdot,a)\n\\land\\mathrm{NormalSymmetryFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathscr G,\\cdot)\n\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\sigma,P)\n\\land\\{\\pi\\in\\mathscr G:\\pi\\star_a\\sigma=\\sigma\\}\\in\\mathcal F.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}symmetric\\text{-}name}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SymmetricName}_S(\\sigma,P,\\leq_P,\\mathscr G,\\cdot,a,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SymmetrySystem}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\mathscr G,\\cdot,a)\n\\land\\mathrm{NormalSymmetryFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathscr G,\\cdot)\n\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\sigma,P)\n\\land\\{\\pi\\in\\mathscr G:\\pi\\star_a\\sigma=\\sigma\\}\\in\\mathcal F.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}hereditarily\\text{-}symmetric\\text{-}name}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HereditarilySymmetricName}_S(\\sigma,P,\\leq_P,\\mathscr G,\\cdot,a,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\mathrm{SymmetricName}_S(\\sigma,P,\\leq_P,\\mathscr G,\\cdot,a,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\forall\\tau,p\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle\\tau,p\\rangle\\in\\sigma\n\\to\\mathrm{HereditarilySymmetricName}_S(\\tau,P,\\leq_P,\\mathscr G,\\cdot,a,\\mathcal F)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}hereditarily\\text{-}symmetric\\text{-}name}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HereditarilySymmetricName}_S(\\sigma,P,\\leq_P,\\mathscr G,\\cdot,a,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\mathrm{SymmetricName}_S(\\sigma,P,\\leq_P,\\mathscr G,\\cdot,a,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\forall\\tau,p\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle\\tau,p\\rangle\\in\\sigma\n\\to\\mathrm{HereditarilySymmetricName}_S(\\tau,P,\\leq_P,\\mathscr G,\\cdot,a,\\mathcal F)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The action and hereditary clause are well-founded recursions on forcing-name rank.</li>\n<li>Only names occurring as first coordinates of pairs in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> are checked; the conditions <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> themselves are not incorrectly treated as names.</li>\n<li>The forcing order, group operation, and action are carried by every predicate.  No subgroup lattice or permutation action is reconstructed from the filter alone.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-name.md","status":"resolved","id":"ec28b62254928d73","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-name.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md","status":"resolved","id":"59685d062adf2748","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{